Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.10,0:00:05.10,Note,0,0,0,0,,（至今走过的路）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.20,0:01:25.55,Note,0,0,0,0,,（蓝色的地球 明尼苏达）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.50,0:04:24.76,Note,0,0,0,0,,（曼宁 科罗拉多）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.83,0:10:18.87,Note,0,0,0,0,,（爱荷华州出生证明）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.80,0:04:19.99,Title,0,0,0,0,,《邪恶力量》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.70,0:00:21.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸失踪了 我需要你来帮我找到他 我一个人没法做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad's missing. I need you to help me. I can't do this alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.64,0:00:25.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸让我们干这份工作 他希望我们继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad's given us a job to do. He wants us to pick up where he left off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}救助他人 猎杀恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saving people, hunting things.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.44,0:00:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个恶魔杀死了妈妈和杰西\N{\fnArial\fs30}This demon killed Mom and Jess.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.23,0:00:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要找到爸爸和杀死杰西的凶手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta find Dad. I gotta find Jessica's killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.00,0:00:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我叫梅格 - 你这是去哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Meg. - So where you headed?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.57,0:00:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我绝不会告诉你 因为你可能是个变态\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way l'm telling you. You could be some kind of freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.62,0:00:39.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.96,0:00:47.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}1835年 塞缪尔·柯尔特制造了一把特殊的手枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}In 1835, Samuel Colt made a special gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.25,0:00:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}据说这把枪能杀死所有东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}They say this gun can kill anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.18,0:01:03.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会在恶梦里看到幻象 而有时那些幻象会成真\N{\fnArial\fs30}l have these nightmares. And sometimes they come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.32,0:01:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们两个是我唯一拥有的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two are all I've got…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.82,0:01:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我猜我们三个在一起的确会更强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I guess we are stronger as a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.82,0:01:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以猎杀那个恶魔的事情 我们一起去做\N{\fnArial\fs30}We go after this damn thing. Together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.65,0:01:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.85,0:01:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}早上好 能为您效劳吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning. Can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.52,0:01:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想 我有点事… 需要忏悔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I kind of-I need to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.15,0:01:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那正是我作为牧师的职责\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's what I'm here for.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.03,0:02:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我做了些事…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've done some things.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.87,0:02:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都不是什么好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not good things.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.37,0:02:08.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没关系 对那些真心忏悔的人而言 宽恕永在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there's always forgiveness for us if we seek it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.37,0:02:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对每个人都是吗？你确定？\N{\fnArial\fs30}For everyone? Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.96,0:02:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想说 救赎正是为罪人而存在的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like to say: Salvation was created for sinners.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.51,0:02:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉我 是什么事让你耿耿于怀？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me what's on your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.89,0:02:26.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我说了谎 很多次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, l-I've lied a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.23,0:02:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我曾偷盗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've stolen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.39,0:02:30.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我欲望横生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've lusted.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.27,0:02:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不久前 我遇见一个男人 他是个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the other day, I met this man. A nice guy, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.74,0:02:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们愉快地聊了会儿天 跟现在差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we had a really good chat. Sort of like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.87,0:02:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后我撕裂了他的喉咙 把他的心脏从胸腔里掏出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I slit his throat and ripped his heart out through his chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.62,0:02:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是不是一个坏人呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does that make me a bad person?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.25,0:02:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道你是什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.09,0:02:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不可能进来这里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.42,0:03:00.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是神的领地\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is hallowed ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.13,0:03:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}算了吧 也许这能挡住那些小鬼怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. Maybe that works in the minor leagues…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.93,0:03:07.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但对我可行不通\N{\fnArial\fs30}but not with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.25,0:03:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的力气怎么跟个女人一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You throw like a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.79,0:03:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.46,0:03:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}温彻斯特一家\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Winchesters.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.97,0:03:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已经有一年多没和约翰·温彻斯特联络了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't spoken to John in over a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.60,0:03:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是在浪费时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're wasting your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.97,0:03:50.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即使我知道他们在哪 也绝不会告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if I did know where they were, I'd never tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.81,0:03:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这点我早知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.82,0:04:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是这样了 这就是我所了解的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is it. This is everything I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.66,0:04:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一生都在找这个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, our whole lives we've been searching for this demon, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.87,0:04:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但一直没有线索 一点都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a trace, just nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.50,0:04:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}直到一年多前 我终于发现了这个恶魔的踪迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until about a year ago. For the first time, I picked up a trail.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.42,0:05:00.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那正是你离开的时候 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's when you took off. - Yeah. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.05,0:05:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个恶魔为了进行蛰居必须出来寻找猎物\N{\fnArial\fs30}The demon must have come out of hiding or hibernation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.13,0:05:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么你发现了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what's this trail you found?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.84,0:05:09.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先是在亚利桑那 然后是新泽西和加利福尼亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Starts in Arizona, then New Jersey, California.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.39,0:05:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}屋子被焚为平地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Houses burned down to the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.64,0:05:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}发生不幸的总是某个家庭 就像我们家\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's going after families, just like it went after us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.64,0:05:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 有婴儿的家庭？- 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Families with infants? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.23,0:05:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在那个婴儿满6个月的夜晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}The night of the kid's 6-month birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.86,0:05:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我那天是6个月大？- 正好满6个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I was 6 months old that night? - Exactly 6 months.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.24,0:05:29.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么 正确地说 那个恶魔是冲着那些婴儿来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So basically, this demon is going after these kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.29,0:05:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为了某些目的\N{\fnArial\fs30}for some reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.58,0:05:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这么说它也盯上了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}The same way it came for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.87,0:05:37.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以妈妈和杰西卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}So Mom's death…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.08,0:05:40.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都是因我而死的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jess, it's because of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.59,0:05:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我们还不能确定 萨姆 - 是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We don't know that.Sam. - Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.09,0:05:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 但我却十分确定 - 我已经说过很多次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- l'd say we're sure. - For the last time…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.26,0:05:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 发生这些事不是你的错 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …what happened is not your fault. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.42,0:05:48.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 不是我的错 - 但却是我的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's not my fault, but it's my problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.39,0:05:49.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 那不是你的问题 是我们的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's not, it's our problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.09,0:05:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好了 够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.27,0:06:01.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它为什么要这么做？它想要什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why is it doing it? What does it want?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.98,0:06:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着 我也希望我知道答案 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I wish I had more answers. I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.78,0:06:06.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我总是迟到一步\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've always been one step behind it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.61,0:06:10.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以没能有时间救下那些家庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, l've never gotten there in time to save…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.45,0:06:18.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么在它再次行动前 我们怎么找到它？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how do we find it before it hits again?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.71,0:06:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}会有一些征兆\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are signs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.79,0:06:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我花了不少时间来总结这些模式\N{\fnArial\fs30}It took me a while to see the pattern…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.80,0:06:27.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在火灾的前几天 周围地区会有一系列不寻常的现象\N{\fnArial\fs30}but in the days before these fires, signs crop up in an area.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.76,0:06:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比如牲口死亡 气温波动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cattle deaths, temperature fluctuations…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.26,0:06:32.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}电磁风暴\N{\fnArial\fs30}electrical storms.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.81,0:06:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我后来回去查过\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then I went back and checked, and…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.43,0:06:38.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那些事也曾发生在劳伦斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}These things happened in Lawrence.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.73,0:06:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就在你母亲死的前一周\N{\fnArial\fs30}A week before your mother died.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.15,0:06:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}同样也发生在帕罗奥图（萨姆就读的斯坦福所在地区）\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in Palo Alto…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.15,0:06:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在杰西卡死前\N{\fnArial\fs30}before Jessica.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.49,0:06:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些征兆现在又出现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And these signs, they're starting again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.33,0:07:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 在哪？- 爱荷华州的救世郡\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where? - Salvation, lowa.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.53,0:07:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Goddamn it. - What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.66,0:07:38.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 混蛋 - 发生什么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Son of a bitch. - What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.37,0:07:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我刚接到迦勒的电话 - 他没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I just got a call from Caleb. - ls he okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.87,0:07:44.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他很好 吉姆·墨菲死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's fine. Jim Murphy's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.38,0:07:47.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吉姆 那个牧师？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pastor Jim?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.55,0:07:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 怎么会？- 喉咙被割断了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How? - Throat was slashed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.59,0:07:53.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}死于出血过多\N{\fnArial\fs30}He bled out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.06,0:08:00.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迦勒说在吉姆那里发现了硫磺的痕迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caleb said they found traces of sulfur at Jim's place.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.23,0:08:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}A demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.85,0:08:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 是我们在找的这个 - 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The demon? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.81,0:08:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能他只是不幸被杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could be he just got-He got careless, he slipped up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.07,0:08:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也可能是那个恶魔知道我们接近真相了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe the demon knows we're getting close.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.53,0:08:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我们现在怎么做？- 我们现在必须分秒必争了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you wanna do? - Now we act like every second counts.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.12,0:08:21.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个郡有两个医疗中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's two hospitals and a health center in this county.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.08,0:08:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们分头去找 这样机会大些\N{\fnArial\fs30}We split up, we cover more ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.25,0:08:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我需要出生记录 以及所有在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want records. I want a list of every infant…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.59,0:08:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}下周满6个月大的婴儿名单\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's gonna be 6 months old in the next week.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.59,0:08:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸 那样的婴儿有很多 我们怎么知道究竟会是哪个？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That could be dozens of kids. How the hell are we gonna know…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.76,0:08:35.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我们一个一个查 - 我们会看看 这就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …which one's the right one? - We'll check them all, that's how.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.05,0:08:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你有更好的办法吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got any better ideas?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.06,0:08:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.65,0:08:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.11,0:08:57.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.87,0:09:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是吉姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Jim.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.29,0:09:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不能…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I can't…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.63,0:09:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要结束这一切 一定要结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}This ends now. I'm ending it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.97,0:09:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无论用什么方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care what it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.52,0:10:08.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}资料在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here you go, officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.85,0:10:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 谢谢 - 不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you. - You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.16,0:10:28.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗨 需要我为你效劳吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. ls there anything I can do for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.58,0:10:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 天 当然需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.54,0:10:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}实际上 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only I…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.21,0:10:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正在工作 所以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Working right now, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.10,0:11:30.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}火车\N{\fnArial\fs30}A train.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.00,0:12:34.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.00,0:12:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我来吧 看来你的手不够用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. Here, let me hold that. You look like you don't need that anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.67,0:12:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.84,0:12:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她真漂亮 是你的孩子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's gorgeous. Is she yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.89,0:12:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 是啊 - 嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.01,0:12:52.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不好意思 我是萨姆 我刚搬过来住\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, I'm rude. l'm Sam. I just moved in up the block.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.02,0:12:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 哦 嗨 我叫摩妮卡 - 摩妮卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, hey. l'm Monica. - Monica.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.89,0:12:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 这是罗茜 - 罗茜？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is Rosie. - Rosie?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.23,0:12:58.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 嗨 罗茜 - 欢迎入住\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi, Rosie. - So welcome to the neighborhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.81,0:12:59.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.52,0:13:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 她真乖 - 是啊 她从来不哭\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's such a good baby. - I know, she-l mean, she never cries.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.15,0:13:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只是盯着人看\N{\fnArial\fs30}She just stares at everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.36,0:13:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有时你甚至会觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes she looks at you and I swear it's-
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.74,0:13:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她在读你的思想\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like she's reading your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.70,0:13:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么你呢莫妮卡 你们在这里住了多久？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you? Have you lived here long?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.87,0:13:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我和我丈夫在罗茜出生前买了那边的房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}My husband and l, we bought our place just before Rosie was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.17,0:13:19.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 那么罗茜现在多大了？- 她今天正好6个月大\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How old is Rosie? - She's 6 months today.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.38,0:13:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 很棒吧 茁壮成长 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's big, right? Growing like a weed. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.72,0:13:34.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 莫妮卡 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Monica? - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.89,0:13:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}万事小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just… Just take care of yourself, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.06,0:13:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你也一样 萨姆 回见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. You too, Sam. We'll see you around.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.57,0:13:43.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 哦 当然 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, definitely. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.07,0:13:46.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, there's Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.14,0:14:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在干…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.15,0:15:04.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗茜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rosie.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.17,0:15:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 幻象 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A vision? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.21,0:15:32.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我看到那个恶魔把一个女人定在天花板上烧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw the demon burning a woman on the ceiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.34,0:15:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你认为这会发生在这个女人身上因为…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think it will happen to this woman because…?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.85,0:15:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为事情总是完全按我看到的发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because these things happen exactly the way I see them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.52,0:15:40.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一开始他只是做恶梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, they started out as nightmares.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.52,0:15:42.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}后来连白天醒着也能看到幻象了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then they started happening while he was awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.98,0:15:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 没错 要我说 - 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. It's like-I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.65,0:15:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}越接近与那个恶魔有关的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like the closer I get to anything involving the demon…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.74,0:15:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些幻象也越清晰\N{\fnArial\fs30}the stronger the visions get.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.70,0:15:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们打算什么时候告诉我这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, when were you gonna tell me about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.70,0:15:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们不知道这意味着什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't know what it meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.20,0:15:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你弟弟有这种现象\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something like this starts happening to your brother…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.87,0:16:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你该拿起电话打给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}you pick up the phone and you call me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.92,0:16:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给你电话？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.42,0:16:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是开玩笑吧 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.63,0:16:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我在劳伦斯时给你打过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, I called you from Lawrence. All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.05,0:16:14.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆在我快死的时候也给你打过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam called you when I was dying. I mean, getting you on the phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.39,0:16:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}接通你电话的几率比我中彩票还低\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a better chance of winning the lottery.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.35,0:16:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说的对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.52,0:16:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}虽然我还不太适应你们这种新态度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although I'm not real crazy…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.90,0:16:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但你是对的 我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}about this new tone of yours, you're right. l'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.07,0:16:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着 不管我看到没看到 事实是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, guys, visions or no visions, the fact is…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.57,0:16:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个恶魔今晚就会出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}we know the demon is coming tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.78,0:16:38.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那家人会像我们一样经历一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this family's gonna go through the same hell we went through.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.91,0:16:40.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 他们不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, they're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.66,0:16:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今后也不会再有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one is, ever again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.42,0:16:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}喂 Sam\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello. Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.92,0:16:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 是谁？- 好好想想 你会想起来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who is this? - Think real hard. It'll come to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.26,0:17:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}梅格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meg.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.60,0:17:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我记得你已经掉出窗外了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last time I saw you, you fell out of a window.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.94,0:17:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错 你们干的好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.73,0:17:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}顺便说一句 那可着实伤了我感情 伤感情？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That really hurt my feelings, by the way. Just your feelings?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.99,0:17:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那不过是逢场作戏罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was a seven-story drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.57,0:17:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我和你爸爸说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me speak to your dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.45,0:17:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我爸爸 我不知道他在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad? I don't know where my dad is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.25,0:17:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}该是成年人谈正经事的时候了 萨姆 让我和他说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time for the grownups to talk, Sam. Let me speak to him now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.80,0:17:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is John.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.76,0:17:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嗨 约翰 我是梅格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Howdy, John. I'm Meg.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.81,0:17:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是你儿子的一个朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a friend of your boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.48,0:17:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也是眼看着你的好朋友吉姆·墨菲淹死在自己血里的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm also the one who watched Jim Murphy choke on his own blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.98,0:17:53.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还在听吗？约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still there, John boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.28,0:17:56.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我在 - 那是昨天的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- l'm here. - Well, that was yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.28,0:17:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今天我在林肯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today, l'm in Lincoln…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.66,0:18:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这里有你的另一个老朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}visiting another old friend of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.99,0:18:06.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他想和你打个招呼\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants to say hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.12,0:18:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}约翰 不管他们做什么 不要给他们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}John, whatever they do, don't give-
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.96,0:18:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迦勒？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caleb?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.17,0:18:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迦勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caleb.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.17,0:18:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着 他没有参与任何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You listen to me. He's got nothing to do with anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.80,0:18:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}放了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You let him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.47,0:18:22.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们知道你得到了柯尔特 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know you have the Colt, John.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.68,0:18:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我不知道你在说什么 - 噢 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't know what you're talking about. - Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.81,0:18:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 好吧 那听听这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}So listen to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.28,0:18:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迦勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Caleb.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.19,0:18:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 迦勒 - 听到了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Caleb. - You hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.78,0:18:43.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是你朋友死亡的声音 我们再来一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the sound of your friend dying. Now let's try this again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.83,0:18:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们知道你有那把枪 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know you have the gun, John. Word travels fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.16,0:18:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对我们而言 你刚刚是在向我们宣战\N{\fnArial\fs30}So as far as we're concerned, you just declared war.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.37,0:18:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以那是战争的必备要素 伤亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this is what war looks like. It has casualties.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.05,0:18:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会杀了你的 你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna kill you. You know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.17,0:19:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 来吧 小心自己的血压\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, John, please. Mind your blood pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.51,0:19:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现实就是这样 我们得继续我们要做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is the thing: We're gonna keep doing what we're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.56,0:19:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而你的朋友 任何帮助过你的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your friends, anyone who's ever helped you…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.39,0:19:14.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那些曾为你提供避难所的人 你爱的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}gave you shelter, anyone you ever loved…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.19,0:19:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都会死 除非你给我们那把枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}they'll all die unless you give us that gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.87,0:19:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我等着呢 约翰 你最好在下次铃声响起前给我答复\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm waiting, Johnny. Better answer before the buzzer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.41,0:19:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我答应你 - 你说什么？我没听太清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - Sorry, I didn't quite get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.42,0:19:36.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我说好的 我会给你柯尔特\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said, okay. I'll bring you the Colt.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.96,0:19:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}林肯这有个仓库 就在沃巴什湖街的拐角\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a warehouse in Lincoln on the corner of Wabash and Lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.55,0:19:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们在那里见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna meet me there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.14,0:19:46.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我需要几天才能开车赶过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna take me about a day's drive to get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.93,0:19:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 今晚午夜在那里见面 - 不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Meet me there at midnight tonight. - That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.60,0:19:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我赶不过去 我不能带把枪直接上飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't get there in time and I can't just carry a gun on a plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.85,0:19:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 那我猜你的朋友就要死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, then I guess your friends die, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.77,0:20:01.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你决定要来赴约的话 一个人来\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you do decide to make it, come alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.62,0:20:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你这是在看什么呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.96,0:20:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 这么说 - 你觉得梅格是个恶魔？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So you think Meg is a demon?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.02,0:20:17.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即使她不是 也肯定被一个恶魔控制着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either that, or she's possessed by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.92,0:20:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 无论如何 这并不重要 - 我们现在怎么做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- lt doesn't really matter. - What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.17,0:20:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我要去林肯 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- l'm going to Lincoln. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.26,0:20:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我似乎没有选择的余地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't seem like I have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.01,0:20:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我不去 很多人会死 我们的朋友会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I don't go, a lot of people die. Our friends die.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.64,0:20:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸 那个恶魔今晚就会出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, the demon is coming tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.65,0:20:32.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}袭击莫妮卡和她的家人 我们只有那把枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}for Monica and her family.That gun is all we got.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.57,0:20:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不能就这样把枪交出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't just hand it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.44,0:20:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁说我要交出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who said anything about handing it over?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.48,0:20:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}除了我们和那几个吸血鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides us and a couple vampires, no one's really seen the gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.61,0:20:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 没人见过这把枪 - 所以没人知道这枪是什么样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No one knows what it looks like. - So, what, you're just gonna…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.69,0:20:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 那你想怎么样？随便找把枪冒名顶替？- 古董店\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …pick up a ringer at a pawnshop? - Antique store.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.49,0:20:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你想给梅格一把假枪 指望她不会发现？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hand Meg a fake gun and hope she doesn't notice?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.12,0:20:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要看上去差不多 她应该不会那么快发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, as long as it's close, she shouldn't be able to tell the difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.95,0:20:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但那能拖多久？如果她发现了你怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}For how long? What happens when she figures it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.50,0:20:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只是想拖延几小时 仅此而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just-l just need to buy a few hours, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.17,0:21:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是说给我和迪恩留出几小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean, for Dean and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.80,0:21:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你想让我们留在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want us to stay here…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.22,0:21:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}单独对付那个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}and kill this demon by ourselves?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.35,0:21:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.85,0:21:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不想再失去我爱的人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna stop losing people we love.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.69,0:21:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我希望你能去上学 我希望迪恩能有个家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to go to school. I want-l want Dean to have a home.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.86,0:21:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我希望玛丽活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want Mary alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.49,0:21:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.96,0:21:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只是想要这一切都结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want this to be over.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.74,0:22:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}找到了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.13,0:22:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道这是个陷阱 是吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know this is a trap, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.93,0:22:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是说梅格要你一个去\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why Meg wants you to come alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.72,0:22:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我能对付她 武器我都备全了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can handle her. I got a whole arsenal loaded.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.64,0:22:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 圣水… 护身符 - 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Holy water, Mandaic amulets… - Dad…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.27,0:22:40.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.56,0:22:44.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 向我保证 - 保证什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Promise me something. - What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.32,0:22:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一旦有什么不对 马上跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}This thing goes south, just get the hell out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.45,0:22:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}千万不要死 你知道你对我们有多重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't get yourself killed, all right? You're no good to us dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.45,0:22:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same goes for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.46,0:23:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.63,0:23:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这把枪的子弹是特制的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They made the bullets special for this Colt.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.26,0:23:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在只剩4发了 没有子弹 这把枪就废了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's only four of them left, and without them this gun is useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.81,0:23:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 所以好好用每一发子弹 - 知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You make every shot count. - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.19,0:23:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这场仗我们等了很长时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been waiting a long time for this fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.98,0:23:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可惜我不能参与其中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now it's here, and l'm not gonna be in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.36,0:23:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们都长大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's up to you boys now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.49,0:23:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是你们的战斗 要你们来打\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your fight. You finish this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.12,0:23:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去终结这场最初由我开始的战斗 明白吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You finish what I started. You understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.10,0:24:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们很快会再见的 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll see you soon, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.73,0:24:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.55,0:24:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.77,0:26:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要不我们说有煤气泄漏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we could tell them there's a gas leak.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.93,0:26:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许他们会离开家几小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might get them out of the house for a few hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.52,0:26:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这种好事有几次发生在我们身上？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and how many times has that actually worked for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.27,0:26:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.07,0:26:19.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或者干脆告诉他们真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could always tell them the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.49,0:26:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 不行 - 我也知道不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - No, I know, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.91,0:26:27.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. I know. I just…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.08,0:26:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在想该怎么救这些人 Sam 我们一起行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}- With what's coming for these people… - We only got one move and you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.88,0:26:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等那个恶魔现出真身\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta wait for that demon to show itself and then…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.84,0:26:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后在它行凶前结果了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}we get it before it gets them.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.85,0:26:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不知道爸爸现在干得怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wonder how Dad is doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.73,0:26:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我希望我们是在那里支援他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd feel a lot better if we were there backing him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.06,0:26:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我更希望他能在这里支援我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd feel a lot better if he were here backing us up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.12,0:28:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}感觉很奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.83,0:28:37.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.29,0:28:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这么多年 我们一直期待着这一刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}After all these years, we're finally here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.59,0:28:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在终于等到了 却有种不真实的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't seem real.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.30,0:28:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们只要尽力做好工作 保住小命 像往常一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just gotta keep our heads and do our job, like always.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.10,0:28:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊 但这次不同寻常\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but this isn't like always.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.23,0:28:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我承认\N{\fnArial\fs30}True.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.82,0:28:59.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.95,0:29:05.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.45,0:29:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.95,0:29:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所有的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}For everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.66,0:29:16.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你总是在背后支持我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've always had my back, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.13,0:29:20.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即使我无法依靠其他任何人 我总是能指望和依靠你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even when I couldn't count on anyone, I could always count on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.13,0:29:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.63,0:29:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些话我想让你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, I just wanted to let you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.34,0:29:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 以防万一… - 哇 你开什么玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just in case. - Whoa. Whoa. Whoa. Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.97,0:29:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 什么？- 不要说什么万一你有什么不测之类的鬼话\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Don't say, "Just in case…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.85,0:29:35.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可还不想听临终遗言\N{\fnArial\fs30}something happens to you." I don't wanna hear that freaking speech, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.52,0:29:37.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着 今晚没人会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody's dying tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.60,0:29:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们不会 那家人也不会 没有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not us, not that family, nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.36,0:29:43.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}除了那个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except that demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.49,0:29:45.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个该死的混蛋活不过今晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}That evil son of a bitch isn't getting any older than tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.78,0:29:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听懂了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.71,0:30:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}约翰 你来了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}John. You made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.67,0:30:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是太遗憾了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too bad, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.09,0:30:06.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我还想多杀几个人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was hoping to kill more of your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.55,0:30:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抱歉让你失望了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry to disappoint.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.80,0:30:11.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}难怪你两个儿子都长得一表人才\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see where your boys get their good looks.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.39,0:30:13.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不过我得承认\N{\fnArial\fs30}Though I must admit…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.60,0:30:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我原以为 他们口中的你… 会更高大些\N{\fnArial\fs30}considering what they say about you, I thought you'd be taller.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.02,0:30:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看来你不太健谈啊…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, aren't you the chatty one.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.90,0:30:25.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你想直接进入正题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna get to business?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.15,0:30:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.66,0:30:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把枪交出来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you hand over the gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.49,0:30:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我这么做了 我怎么活着出去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I give you the gun, how do I get out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.58,0:30:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你真如你儿子说的那么棒 你早该想好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're as good as they say you are, I'm sure you'll figure something out.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.58,0:30:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 是啊 也许我直接杀你 - 你想杀我吗？请便\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maybe l'll just shoot you. - You wanna shoot me, baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.09,0:30:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但什么也不会改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead. lt won't end anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.92,0:30:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今天来的可不止我一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's more where I came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.35,0:30:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.06,0:30:57.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他绝对不像我那么有趣 我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not nearly as much fun as I am, I can tell you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.43,0:31:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以我建议你交出手枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I suggest you give us the gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.44,0:31:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.83,0:31:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是柯尔特？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the Colt?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.63,0:31:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你觉得呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.53,0:31:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你杀我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shot me!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.49,0:31:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不敢相信你竟然杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe you just shot me!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.33,0:32:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是赝品\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.35,0:32:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你死定了 约翰 你的儿子也死定了 - 我从没用过那枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're dead, John. Your boys are dead. - l've never used the gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.10,0:32:22.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 怎么会知道它不管用 - 我现在一点没心情谈这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How could I know it wouldn't work? - l'm so not in the mood for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.48,0:32:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我刚被枪杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've just been shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.02,0:32:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你真该庆幸这枪不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then I guess you're lucky the gun wasn't real.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.23,0:32:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真有趣 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's funny, John.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.90,0:32:32.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们要把你的皮剥下来 那一定很有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna strip the skin from your bones, but that was funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.74,0:33:21.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是圣水 干得不错 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy water, John.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.29,0:33:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真的很可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.38,0:33:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸不接电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad's not answering.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.22,0:33:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许梅格迟到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe Meg was late.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.93,0:33:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 也许服务信号不好 - 也许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maybe cell reception's bad. - Yeah, well…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.44,0:33:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.32,0:33:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.93,0:34:19.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.14,0:34:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.88,0:34:59.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}离开我家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of my house!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.55,0:35:03.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 离开我家 - 别动 别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get out of my house! - Please. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.51,0:35:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 安静 - 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Please. - Be quiet and listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.35,0:35:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们是来帮你的 行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be quiet and listen. We are trying to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.56,0:35:10.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 查理 - 有什么事吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charlie. - Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.39,0:35:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 一切都好 - 莫妮卡 快去保护孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything okay down there? - Monica, get the baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.90,0:35:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 不要去幼儿园 - 你不要接近她\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't go in the nursery! - You stay away from her!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.86,0:35:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在干。-。-\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you-?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.29,0:35:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗茜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rosie!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.09,0:35:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 它去哪了？- 我的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where the hell did he go? - My baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.88,0:35:41.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 不 等等 - 你们快离开这里 孩子我来抱\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. Wait. - Get her out of here. I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.01,0:35:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 来吧 - 罗茜\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Take her and go. - Rosie!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.89,0:35:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 快走 - 我的孩子…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. My baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.93,0:35:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩会救出她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean's got her.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.61,0:36:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你们离我家人远点 - 不 查理 他们救了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You get away from my family. - No, Charlie, don't. They saved us.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.28,0:36:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们救了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, they saved us.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.79,0:36:58.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.67,0:37:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 它还在里面 - 萨姆 萨姆 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's still in there. - Sam. Sam, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.47,0:37:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 迪恩 让我去 它还在里面 - 你进去就是自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean, let me go. It's still in there. - It's suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.47,0:37:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我不在乎 - 我在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't care. - I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.16,0:37:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快接电话啊 爸爸 该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Dad. Answer your phone, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.67,0:37:39.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有点不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.26,0:37:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你听到我说了吗？肯定有事发生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear me? Something's happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.63,0:37:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你当时让我进去…\N{\fnArial\fs30}lf you had just let me go in there…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.63,0:37:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我就能结束这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}l could have ended all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.85,0:37:52.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 你一直这样想会让自己痛苦不堪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, the only thing you were gonna end was your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.93,0:37:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不会吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.23,0:38:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么 你愿意就这么牺牲自己咯\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what, you're just willing to sacrifice yourself, is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.44,0:38:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 是的 我就是这么想的 - 那不可能 只要有我在一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. Yeah, you're damn right I am. - Well, that's not gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.74,0:38:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 就不会让这种事发生 - 你在说什么？迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not long as I'm around. - What are you talking about, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.70,0:38:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们一生都在追逐这个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been searching for this demon our whole lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.24,0:38:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是我们唯一在乎的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the only thing we've ever cared about.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.91,0:38:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 我也想它死 非常想 但这不值得用你的生命做代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, I wanna waste it. I do. Okay? But it's not worth dying over.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.71,0:38:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 什么 我说真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - I mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.58,0:38:21.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果猎杀这个恶魔意味着牺牲你\N{\fnArial\fs30}If hunting this demon means you getting yourself killed…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.88,0:38:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我但愿我们永远不要找到它\N{\fnArial\fs30}l hope we never find the damn thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.34,0:38:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那东西杀死了杰西\N{\fnArial\fs30}That thing killed Jess.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.30,0:38:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杀死了妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}That thing killed Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.55,0:38:33.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你自己也说过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said yourself once…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.52,0:38:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无论我们做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}that no matter what we do, they're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.52,0:38:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她们都已经走了 不会再回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they're never coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.27,0:38:42.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不许你这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you say that. Not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.90,0:38:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}经历了那么多事 我不许你再这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not after all this. Don't you say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.57,0:38:49.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, look…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.32,0:38:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们三个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}the three of us…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.24,0:38:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是我们所拥有的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's all we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.54,0:39:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也是我的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's all I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.80,0:39:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有时我觉得要让我们大家在一起真的很难\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes I feel like I'm barely holding it together, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.88,0:39:12.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果失去你或者爸爸…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And without you or Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.76,0:39:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.94,0:39:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他现在该回来了 再打给他试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}He should've called by now. Try him again.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.33,0:39:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们俩这次可真把事给搞砸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You boys really screwed up this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.05,0:39:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.43,0:39:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们永远也见不到你们父亲了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're never gonna see your father again.
